# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL — custom transactional email (free tiers). Auth emails already work
# through Supabase's built-in mailer; this is only for "you have a new match"
# notifications. If unset, the app degrades gracefully (in-app notifications only).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RESEND_API_KEY=""
# NOTIFY_EMAIL_FROM="Mutual Transfer <notify@yourdomain.com>"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL — hover-to-Hindi translation. The feature works key-less out of the
# box via the free MyMemory API. Setting a contact email raises MyMemory's free
# daily quota (anonymous ~5k words/day → ~50k words/day). Safe to expose.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_MYMEMORY_EMAIL=""

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTIONAL — verification by official email domain. Comma-separated list of
# domains that auto-verify a profile (e.g. "hcourt.gov.in,districts.ecourts.gov.in").
# Leave empty to require admin manual verification for everyone.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OFFICIAL_EMAIL_DOMAINS=""
